      "GmdIndex" : 8,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Yes, for example, the \"Lookout Castle.\" It's an\r\nimportant castle both culturally and defensively.\r\nIt's been a great hardship for it to fall into\r\nthe hands of the Demon Army.",
        "Jp" : "そう、例えば《展望城》――\r\nあれは文化的にも防衛的にも重要な城\r\n魔軍の手に落ちてしまったのは\r\n大変つらいことです"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 642235,
      "MsgType" : 0,
      "SetMotion" : 0,
