      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "With more people around, disputes and\r\nworries seem to increase.\r\nBut that's just part of life.",
        "Jp" : "人が多くなると揉め事や悩み事も\r\n増えるようですが――\r\nこれも命あってこそのものですものね"
