      "GmdIndex" : 17,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "Arisen, if you're willing, please lend your\r\nstrength to those in need.\r\nEveryone would surely appreciate it.",
        "Jp" : "覚者様、もしよろしければ\r\n問題を抱える人たちにお力をお貸しください\r\nみな、喜ぶことでしょう"
